{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the prologue of <i><strong>Baddies, Inc.</strong></i> in this <strong>free demo</strong> and get a glimpse of what <strong>Loho</strong> has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that your progress will not carry over to the full game.<br><br><i>After getting taken in by a longtime friend of your family, Judy, you\u2019ve become her last hope to save both her and her struggling farm. Travel to Loho Valley and launch your own dating app startup. But beware, in Loho the competition is ruthless. Everyone is hustling for success, and if you slip up, you might end up as someone else\u2019s stepping stone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/extras/bdb86748d40d705dbee70aedcc69d90d.poster.avif?t=1760082968\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/extras/bdb86748d40d705dbee70aedcc69d90d.webm?t=1760082968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loho is not only about business opportunities. It is full of gorgeous women looking to unwind, make connections, or just have a little fun. Baddies, Inc. is a choice-driven adult visual novel, featuring: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9000+ high-resolution renders,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >230+ high-quality animations,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ hours of gameplay,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ girls, ready to steal your heart,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and immersive story where your choices carve your path and its destination.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choices That Matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/extras/54dd973509d4293ac626c716030b3fe1.poster.avif?t=1760082968\" width=656 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/extras/54dd973509d4293ac626c716030b3fe1.webm?t=1760082968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing it safe and outdoing your competition by creating a top-notch app or just blowing up their server room, you're the one responsible for your actions; your path is a reflection of your choices. The same goes for your love life. You will have plenty of admirers, but you will need to stay focused on why you came to Loho in the first place. Your choices will shape both your path and your destination, leading to 8 different endings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Quality Animations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into interactive, high-quality scenes that put you right in the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between POVs, experiment with positions, and enjoy every encounter as its own unique experience. And once unlocked, everything will be available in the <i>gallery</i> for you to view and review <i>whenever you want, as many times as you need</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Over 30 Baddies to Meet!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/extras/65b31b69b84d774a965be6b4a999fd95.poster.avif?t=1760082968\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/extras/65b31b69b84d774a965be6b4a999fd95.webm?t=1760082968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loho is full of life, and in every corner of the city, you may meet a girl ready to share an adventure:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natalie, your open-minded friend with benefits,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lana, your cute co-worker,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandy, a Real Estate agent,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kendra, a MILF investor,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boba, the Flower Shop owner,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even your co-worker's mom!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Loho has someone for everyone, and nobody is out of your reach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smartwatch and Virtual Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/extras/6c681220af6a7217ccdb65a417a3406e.poster.avif?t=1760082968\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/extras/6c681220af6a7217ccdb65a417a3406e.webm?t=1760082968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wish you could have Loho on your wrist? Meet <i>Lexa</i>, your personal virtual assistant, ready to help you anytime. Unlock features as you progress:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check character profiles and their private portfolios,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the internet for business tips or local gossip,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flirt shamelessly with your virtual personal assistant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you cannot remember who that hottie you are talking to is, maybe Lexa can remind you in her own revealing way. Browse the web for the latest gossip on <i>Loho Today</i>, or unlock <strong>exclusive renders</strong> in <i>PhotoHunt</i> by collecting hidden icons during your playthrough!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077640?t=1760082968","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/14582d869c84176b5966bdbc40e90e6dee2e59a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760082968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/725996edd73ab3456382e8cfca2371f8d74f182d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760082968","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/725996edd73ab3456382e8cfca2371f8d74f182d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760082968","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game contains graphic depictions of sex, nudity, strong language, and references to alcohol and drug use.\r\n\r\nAll sexual acts are consensual, and all characters depicted are 21 years of age or older."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the prologue of <i><strong>Baddies, Inc.</strong></i> in this <strong>free demo</strong> and get a glimpse of what <strong>Loho</strong> has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that your progress will not carry over to the full game.<br><br><i>After getting taken in by a longtime friend of your family, Judy, you\u2019ve become her last hope to save both her and her struggling farm. Travel to Loho Valley and launch your own dating app startup. But beware, in Loho the competition is ruthless. Everyone is hustling for success, and if you slip up, you might end up as someone else\u2019s stepping stone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077640/extras/bdb86748d40d705dbee70aedcc69d90d.poster.avif